{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/azizi-gardens-meydan-nad-al-sheba","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":433,"crm_id":"1687","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Azizi Gardens","slug":"azizi-gardens-meydan-nad-al-sheba","display_address":"Nad Al Sheba","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Azizi Developments","price":2622140,"display_price":"2.62M","lattitude":25.1659214,"longitude":55.3052903,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Azizi Gardens is a residential complex developed by Azizi Development. It is located on Meydan Avenue in Mohammed Bin Rashid Al Maktoum, Dubai.</p><p>The complex is characterized by an abundance of landscaped gardens and green spaces. <strong>Studios and apartments are offered with one and two bedroom</strong> floor plans. The apartments are equipped with modern amenities, functional spaces, chic finishes and beautifully designed interiors. The windows are equipped with special perforated panels that allow an optimal amount of natural light into the residence.</p><p>There are a total of 51 residential units in the complex. The building has a large lobby with an unusual eco-friendly design.</p><p>Azizi Gardens offers a wide range of amenities including:</p><p>outdoor pool, gym, restaurants, recreation area, cafes and restaurants, parking, children's playground, jogging tracks, barbecue areas.</p><p>The complex is located along Meydan Avenue and residents have easy access to nearby highways such as Sheikh Zayed Road, Al Khail Road and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road.</p><p>Azizi Gardens is located within a short drive from several popular city attractions, including: Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary - 10 minutes, Dubai Mall -13 minutes, Downtown Dubai -15 minutes, Jumeirah Beach -15 minutes, Dubai International Airport - 15 minutes, Burj Al Arab - 20 minutes, Palm Jumeirah - 21 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1687/images/2024/04/22/in4eiou4D60kAq6dJGa2bbtIAa8NeM6s76mCBIM1.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/22/in4eiou4D60kAq6dJGa2bbtIAa8NeM6s76mCBIM1.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1687/images/2024/04/22/F6188hE5DzJFpy3gQDjlym8TEOu4yPAlsEId5ByE.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/22/F6188hE5DzJFpy3gQDjlym8TEOu4yPAlsEId5ByE.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1687/images/2024/04/22/ZFpYmnjrzogy0ruzBRAoYBsyaUB3PNXQu0mmgddD.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/22/ZFpYmnjrzogy0ruzBRAoYBsyaUB3PNXQu0mmgddD.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2086,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1337,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":6665,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":6666,"title":"80%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Nad Al Sheba  ","publish":1,"currency":"AED","amenities":[{"id":11504,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11505,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11506,"url":null,"text":"Concierge Service","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11507,"url":null,"text":"Children’s pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11508,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11509,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11510,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11511,"url":null,"text":"Shared gym & fitness","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11512,"url":null,"text":"Leisure areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":115